xbrli:xbrl.ind-as:DetailsOfNatureOfExceptionalItems:
Consequent upon settlement agreement 
dated 15th January 2025 entered with one of the LNG supplier, which includes 
payment of US$ 285 million by LNG supplier to the Company towards settlement of 
litigation for non-supply of LNG cargos during FY 2022-23, &nbsp;the Company has 
recognised ₹ 2,440.03 crore (US$ 285 million) as an exceptional income during 
the year ended 31st March 2025. &nbsp;
&nbsp;
&nbsp;
